---
import releaseStatus from "../data/release-status.json";
const { lang = "zh" } = Astro.props;
const english = lang === "en";
const items = english
  ? [
      [
        "Recover data projections",
        "Published CLI/PDH persists projection intent with canonical entities, confirms KG/BM25 separately, and adds bounded retries. Current hosts rebuild in-memory indexes; unknown running deliveries remain protected.",
      ],
      [
        "Review project task changes",
        "Current desktop source gives saved pending tasks in personal projects description previews, native confirmation and atomic receipts. Risk checks detect overdue tasks and unfinished direct dependencies. CLI commands only inspect offline snapshots.",
      ],
      [
        "Read capability status accurately",
        "Automation distinguishes simulation from unsupported execution. Low-code publishing saves a design; outbound SCIM provider sync remains unsupported. Structured CLI audit redaction and RAG replacement are hardened.",
      ],
    ]
  : [
      [
        "数据投影恢复",
        "公开 CLI/PDH 将投影意图与规范化实体一同保存，KG/BM25 分别确认并支持分批重试。当前宿主重建内存索引，未知运行投递继续保留。",
      ],
      [
        "项目任务预览与确认",
        "本轮桌面源码中的个人项目已保存待办任务支持描述预览、原生确认和原子回执。风险只检查逾期与直接依赖阻塞；CLI 命令只读取离线快照。",
      ],
      [
        "能力状态与审计",
        "自动化区分模拟和不支持，低代码发布保存设计，SCIM 出站 provider 尚不执行真实同步。CLI 结构化审计脱敏和 RAG 更新顺序已加固。",
      ],
    ];
---

<section
  class="py-16 border-t border-line bg-cream"
  aria-labelledby="source-update-title"
>
  <div class="container-wide">
    <p class="font-mono text-sm text-muted">
      2026-10-06 · {english ? "Published CLI and desktop source" : "公开 CLI 与桌面源码"} · CLI{" "}
      {releaseStatus.sourceMainCliVersion}
    </p>
    <h2 id="source-update-title" class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold">
      {english
        ? "Recover projections and review task changes"
        : "恢复数据投影，复核项目任务修改"}
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-4xl">
      {english
        ? `CLI ${releaseStatus.recommendedCliVersion} and PDH ${releaseStatus.personalDataHubVersion} are public after exact-commit release gates. Desktop task interactions require the reviewed source at ${releaseStatus.sourceHeadCommit.slice(0, 10)}; the separate v5.0.3.138 installer does not include the new workbench.`
        : `CLI ${releaseStatus.recommendedCliVersion} 与 PDH ${releaseStatus.personalDataHubVersion} 已通过准确提交发布门并公开。桌面任务交互需运行核对至 ${releaseStatus.sourceHeadCommit.slice(0, 10)} 的源码；独立 v5.0.3.138 安装包尚未包含新工作区。`}
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      {items.map(([title, description]) => (
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-paper p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold">{title}</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">{description}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <a
        class="btn-ghost"
        href="https://docs.chainlesschain.com/chainlesschain/data-actions-current.html"
      >
        {english ? "Usage and limits ↗" : "操作与限制 ↗"}
      </a>
      <a
        class="btn-ghost"
        href="https://design.chainlesschain.com/data-actions-update-2026-10-06.html"
      >
        {english ? "Architecture and contracts ↗" : "架构与契约 ↗"}
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
